  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "Q#14 custom-event demo (SUBSCRIBER). Instance blueprint whose OnPing Event graph subscribes to the Hrot.AI.Behaviors.PingEvent custom event: EventEntry exposes the reflected payload 'Value' (int) as a data-out, wired into SetVariable(LastValue). At runtime BlueprintTickSystem's per-slot dispatch fires OnPing whenever a PingEvent is on the bus this frame, mirroring the published Value into the LastValue variable (watch it in the debugger/inspector). Pair with CustomEventPublisherDemo.",
    "Category": "Demo",
    "Recipe": null
  }
